 specific to diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "why": "This is a statistical uncertainty in background predictions, not specific to diboson modeling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar_modelling", "why": "This is specific to ttbar background modeling, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:data-driven-ttbar", "why": "This is specific to data-driven ttbar background estimation, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:spurious-signal", "why": "This is specific to multijet background modeling, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_ltau_lprime", "why": "This is specific to misidentified background uncertainty, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-total-uncertainty", "why": "This is a total background uncertainty, not specific to diboson modeling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vvv-normalization", "why": "This is specific to triboson background normalization, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vertex-reconstruction-efficiency-modelling", "why": "This is specific to primary vertex reconstruction, not directly related to diboson modeling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:singletop-triboson-rare-normalization", "why": "This is specific to single top quark and rare backgrounds, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-extrapolation-bias", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to background prediction, but not specifically to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:losttw_mbb_scale", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the lost-t/W background, which is not the diboson background."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:twz-modelling", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the modelling of a specific process (tWZ), which is not the diboson background (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:underlying_event_parton_shower_uncertainty", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to underlying event and parton shower modelling, which is not specific to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-in-embedded", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to contamination from ttbar and diboson processes, but it is not specific to the diboson background modelling uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_ltau_had", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to misidentified background, which is not the diboson background."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pdf-alphas", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to PDF and alpha_s for major backgrounds, which may include diboson, but it is not specific to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbarZ-modelling", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to ttbar+Z modelling, which is not the diboson background (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:zjets_normalization", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to Z+jets background normalization, which is not the diboson background."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:misid_lepton_estimation", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to misidentified-lepton background estimation, which is not the diboson background."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:zjets-diboson-higgs-normalization", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to normalization of Z/gamma*+jets, diboson, and Higgs boson backgrounds, which includes diboson but is not specific to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:syst:background_fit", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to background fit (ABCD closure), which is not specific to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pileup-modelling", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to pileup modelling, which is not specific to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:symmetric_background_estimate", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to symmetric background estimate statistical uncertainty, which is not specific to diboson background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:luminosi