e leading jet)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:yabs_top_vs_pt_top", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (rapidity and transverse momentum of top quarks)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_pt_top", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (invariant mass and transverse momentum of top quarks)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:njet_vs_pt_top", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (number of jets and transverse momentum of top quarks)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-jet-multiplicity", "why": "Measures a differential WZ cross section but for a different observable (jet multiplicity)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-w-lepton", "why": "Measures a differential WZ cross section but for a different observable (transverse momentum of lepton from W decay)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_ll_vs_m_ll", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (dilepton invariant mass and transverse momentum)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:wpm-z-pt-ratio", "why": "Measures a ratio of differential cross sections but for a different observable (transverse momentum)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-detall-norm", "why": "Measures a normalized differential cross section but for a different process ($t\bar{t}W$) and observable (pseudorapidity difference)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-norm", "why": "Measures a normalized differential cross section but for a different process ($t\bar{t}W$) and observable (jet transverse energy sum)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_pt_ttbar", "why": "Measures a double-differential cross section but for different observables (invariant mass and transverse momentum of top quark pair)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:m_ttbar_vs_deta_ttbar", "why": "This is a double-differential cross section but not for the process or variable asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable: