th fit."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_ggf2jets", "why": "This is a specific signal strength parameter for a particular production mode, but not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier as asked."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-h-differential", "why": "This is a signal strength in specific pT bins, which is more specific than the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-fiducial-validation", "why": "This is a validation measurement for Z->bb signal strength, not related to the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:kappa-lambda", "why": "This is a trilinear self-coupling modifier, which is a different observable from the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "why": "This is a specific signal strength for VH production, which is more specific than the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:observed-significance", "why": "This is the significance of the Higgs boson signal per production mode, not the signal strength modifier itself."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "This is a set of effective coupling modifiers, which is a different observable from the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "why": "This is a resolved coupling modifier, which is a different observable from the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-wh", "why": "This is a specific cross-section times branching ratio for WH production, which is more specific than the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-inclusive", "why": "This is a signal strength for Z+jets, which is a different process from the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "why": "This is a specific signal strength for ZH production, which is more specific than the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution of the Higgs boson rapidity, which is not related to the signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "why": "This is a specific signal strength for WH production, which is more specific than the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:p-value-mu-h-compatibility", "why": "This is a p-value for differential signal strengths, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "why": "This is a ratio of coupling modifiers, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength for a different process (VZ, Z→bb), not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "why": "This is the branching fraction for an invisible decay, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "why": "This is a signal strength for a different process (ttbar), not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mbb-spectrum", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution for a dark Higgs boson candidate, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_quadratic", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not the inclusive signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zprime-hgamma-hbb", "why": "This is a different observable, involving a Z' particle and Higgs decay to bb, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_h", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution of the Higgs boson transverse momentum, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_no_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on a 47-parameter SMEFT fit basis, which is not directly related to the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential cross section for Higgs boson production, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "why": "This is a branching fraction ratio relative to H→ZZ, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_tot", "why": "This is the total Higgs boson production cross section, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "why": "This is the inclusive cross-section for t-tbar-W-, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:model-independent-upper-limit", "why": "This is a set of upper limits on BSM cross sections and signal yields, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec", "why": "This is the inclusive cross-section for t-tbar-W+, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "why": "This is a set of intervals on SMEFT Wilson coefficients affecting VH production and H→bb decay, not the H→γγ signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ggHH", "why": "This is a signal strength for a different process (ggHH), not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ZH", "why": "This is a signal strength for a different process (ZH->4b), not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "This is a differential fiducial cross section, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tan_alpha", "why": "This is a CP-mixing angle in the Higgs-gluon coupling, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable