inty related to the electroweak plus ttbar background, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:rare_sm_ttV_ttH_xsec", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to rare standard model processes, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:single_top_modelling", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to single-top production, which includes parton shower and initial/final state radiation uncertainties, but it is not directly related to the signal total cros"}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:cross-section-normalisation", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the normalization of various backgrounds, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:rw-pileup", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to pileup, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-isr-fsr", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the modeling of initial and final state radiation in ttbar production, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wh-xsec", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the production of WH in the standard model, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar_fsr", "why": "This is a systematic uncertainty related to the final-state radiation in ttbar production, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_total_systematic", "why": "This is a total systematic uncertainty for a specific channel, which is not directly related to the signal total cross-section theory uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ggf_hh_pdf_3pct", "why": "This is a 