ractions, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-vh-brww-total", "why": "This is a specific process (VH) and includes branching fractions, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-zh-brww-total", "why": "This is a specific process (ZH) and includes branching fractions, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:wz-total-xsec", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (pp->WZ), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-wc-particle-inclusive", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for a different process (W+c), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ratio_el_tot", "why": "This is a ratio involving the total cross section, but not the total Higgs production cross section itself."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-wc-parton-inclusive", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for a different process (W+c), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "why": "This is a signal strength, not a total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "why": "This is a differential fiducial cross section, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_z", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (Z) and includes branching fractions, not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wplus", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (W+) and includes branching fractions, not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "why": "This is a total cross section for a different process (t-tbar-W), not Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not the total Higgs boson production cross section."}