."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-HH", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_tH", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ZZ", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_ttH", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ggHH", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_inclusive", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-qqHH", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_ttH_x_Bgammagamma", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the specific signal strength asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec_br_acc_eff_limit", "why": "This is a limit on the product of cross-section, branching ratio, acceptance, and efficiency, which is not directly related to the signal strength for the invisible decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-schichi-bb", "why": "This is the product of cross-section and branching ratio for the Higgs to bb decay, which is not related to the invisible decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential cross-section measurement, which is not directly related to the signal strength for the invisible decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "why": "This is a specific signal strength for the WH production mode with the Higgs decaying to bb, which is not related to